WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:04.573
My lady really knows how to pick the time to come pay respects

00:06.040 --> 00:06.680
No

00:06.760 --> 00:07.560
Father

00:07.640 --> 00:09.240
Mother comes every year at this time

00:09.320 --> 00:10.987
Just rarely meets with Father

00:11.480 --> 00:13.040
Eunuch Fan knows about this

00:13.120 --> 00:14.520
Please investigate, Father

00:14.680 --> 00:15.840
Yes, Your Majesty

00:15.920 --> 00:19.120
The lady comes every year to pay respects to the empress

00:19.200 --> 00:20.560
Since it's done well

00:20.640 --> 00:22.040
Then I'll reward you

00:22.640 --> 00:24.040
What do you want?
